{"title": "Arcane Echomalefaction", "pageid": 28398, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Arcane_Echomalefaction", "categories": ["Damage Rider As Source", "Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Arcane Echomalefaction</b> is a passive feature which applies Reverberation on enemies after applying a condition.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When the wearer inflicts a condition upon a hostile creature, they also inflict 2 turns of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reverberation_(Condition)\" title=\"Reverberation (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reverberation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reverberation_(Condition)\" title=\"Reverberation (Condition)\">Reverberation</a>.<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Reverberation\"> Condition: Reverberation </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reverberation_(Condition)\" title=\"Reverberation (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reverberation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reverberation_(Condition)\" title=\"Reverberation (Condition)\">Reverberation</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has a -1 penalty to <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> per remaining turn.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>When the entity has 5 or more turns of Reverberation, it takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a><abbr title=\"Damage Rider As Source\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">DRS</a></abbr> damage and must succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Constitution Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> or fall <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>. The condition is removed afterward.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Creatures <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types#Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">Immune</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage can't receive Reverberation.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour\" title=\"Boots of Stormy Clamour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour\" title=\"Boots of Stormy Clamour\">Boots of Stormy Clamour</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Arcane Echomalefaction triggers only once for any action or effect which inflicts a condition and affects only one target per trigger. If an action applies a condition to multiple targets simultaneously or sequentially (such as the persistent <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blinded</a> aura from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lathander%27s_Light_(Condition)\" title=\"Lathander's Light (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Lathander%27s_Light_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lathander%27s_Light_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Lathander%27s_Light_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lathander%27s_Light_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Lathander%27s_Light_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Lathander%27s_Light_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lathander's Light\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Lathander%27s_Light_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lathander%27s_Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Lathander%27s_Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lathander%27s_Light_(Condition)\" title=\"Lathander's Light (Condition)\">Lathander's Light</a>), the effect triggers only on the first target to receive the condition, even if additional targets become affected later in the turn.</li>\n<li>Applying <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reverberation_(Condition)\" title=\"Reverberation (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reverberation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reverberation_(Condition)\" title=\"Reverberation (Condition)\">Reverberation</a> does not trigger this passive.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Arcane Echomalefaction triggers under many circumstances where it appears it should not, due to hidden technical conditions, such as when a ranged weapon attack misses, when <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/30px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/40px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\">Sanctuary</a> is cast near enemies, or when revealing an invisible enemy with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility\" title=\"See Invisibility\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp/20px-See_Invisibility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp/30px-See_Invisibility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp/40px-See_Invisibility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"See Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp/20px-See_Invisibility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility\" title=\"See Invisibility\">See Invisibility</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195551\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.081 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2828/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35239/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11842/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/20